Package: tanmai
Title: Chess Board Screenshot to Best Move
Version: 1.5.0
Authors@R: person("tenmeh", email = "81738153+tenmeh@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A golem Shiny app that reads a chess board screenshot (drag-drop
    or clipboard paste), recognizes the position with template matching, and
    suggests the best move via a local Stockfish engine.
URL: https://tenmeh.github.io/tanmai/, https://github.com/tenmeh/tanmai
BugReports: https://github.com/tenmeh/tanmai/issues
